flowchart TD
    A[Voice Input] --> B{Input Source}
    B -->|Discord Bridge| C[Node.js Voice Capture + VAD]
    B -->|Local Microphone| D[C# Microphone Capture]

    C --> E{STT Mode}
    D --> F[Local STT Pipeline]

    E -->|Groq Whisper| G[Cloud STT]
    E -->|AssemblyAI| H[Cloud STT]
    E -->|Local| I[C# Whisper STT]

    F --> J[Transcribed Text]
    G --> J
    H --> J
    I --> J

    J --> K[Conversation History]
    J --> L[Semantic Memory Search]
    K --> M[Prompt Builder]
    L --> M

    M --> N{Inference Backend}
    N -->|Remote Provider| O[RemoteInferenceClient]
    N -->|Local Ollama| P[OllamaClient]

    O --> Q[LLM Response]
    P --> Q

    Q --> R[Memory Write-Back Queue]
    Q --> S{TTS Mode}

    S -->|VOICEVOX Local| T[Local TTS]
    S -->|Cloud TTS| U[Remote TTS]

    T --> V[PCM Audio Output]
    U --> V

    V --> W{Output Target}
    W -->|Discord| X[Bridge Playback in Voice Channel]
    W -->|Local Runtime| Y[Local Audio Playback]

    J --> Z[Local HTTP API]
    Q --> Z
    V --> Z
